{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, קְצָת","hw":"קְצָת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְצָת</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> end <strong>(</strong>so BH (late); 𝔗 (<a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:2\" href=\"/Genesis.47.2\">Gn 47:2</a>); not Syriac; cf. Egyptian Aramaic RÉS<sup>361 A4</sup><strong>)</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְק׳</span> <em>at the end of</em> (months, days) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:26\" href=\"/Daniel.4.26\">Dn 4:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:31\" href=\"/Daniel.4.31\">31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־ק׳מַלְכוּתָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:43\" href=\"/Daniel.2.43\">2:43</a> = <em>part of</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנַּהּ</span> v d; cf. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, קְצָת²\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_קְצָת²\", dir=\"rtl\">קְצָת</a> <strong>2</strong>).","next":"BDB Aramaic, קְצַף","prev":"BDB Aramaic, קצא"}